{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18907","headline":"奉送家兄归王屋山隐居二首 二 · 刘禹锡","name":"奉送家兄归王屋山隐居二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春来山事好，归去亦逍遥。\n水净苔莎色，露香芝术苗。\n登台吸瑞景，飞步翼神飙。\n愿荐埙篪曲，相将学玉箫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18907.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18907","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}